node 61 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 0
  s text Pocket console, Picture band. Primitives and Sketch 3D build the device, a GLSL game plays on its screen, and the 3D View stages it in front of a Y2K poster wall.
  f width 340
  f height 170
end
node 62 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 2676
  s text Sound band. Six Piano Rolls (open one to edit its notes) play chiptune at 120 bpm: square lead, triangle bass, noise drums, jump and coin blips locked to the hero's hops.
  f width 340
  f height 192
end
node 63 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 5266
  s text LFOs sway, raise and push the camera; a Random drifts the roll. The camera orbits the console, cranes on every bar and punches in on the kick, which also flashes the glyphs.
  f width 340
  f height 192
end
node 64 Compositing Comment
  pos 1380 1230
